WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.305
Mount your iPhone

00:00:01.117 --> 00:00:02.213
on Linux no

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:02.908
cable needed

00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:04.735
iphone-linux makes

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:05.761
an iPhone appear

00:00:05.584 --> 00:00:06.445
as a normal

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.412
Linux folder over

00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:07.883
Wi-Fi

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:09.157
with full read

00:00:08.969 --> 00:00:10.100
and write access

00:00:09.924 --> 00:00:10.902
and no Apple

00:00:10.714 --> 00:00:11.374
account

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:13.199
It combines FUSE

00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:13.824
with the same

00:00:13.636 --> 00:00:15.404
wireless protocol Xcode

00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:16.465
uses for debugging

00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:17.538
because the old

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.399
USB route with

00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:19.626
ifuse is broken

00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:20.993
on iOS 17

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:21.560
and later

00:00:22.094 --> 00:00:22.907
You can copy

00:00:22.719 --> 00:00:23.509
photos out of

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.110
DCIM

00:00:24.205 --> 00:00:25.443
write files or

00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:26.197
mount a single

00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:27.365
app's Documents folder

00:00:27.495 --> 00:00:28.202
as long as

00:00:28.014 --> 00:00:28.780
the phone has

00:00:28.592 --> 00:00:29.759
Developer Mode on

00:00:30.294 --> 00:00:31.308
Full story on

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:32.015
the dashboard
